// Box.fol — package source file
// Spec: language-ref.md > Generic Types, Impredicativity
//
// The container used by the impredicativity discussion in PolyId.fol.
//
// A higher-kinded parameter declares its own arity, which is how a type
// constructor parameter such as `Transformer(F(_), G(_))` is written.

@co.dap.generic(typename=T)
_ co.lang.struct = {
    value T;
}
